<title>FRANCE: Cie Maritime d'Affretement to buy CGM - CGM source.</title>
<headline>Cie Maritime d'Affretement to buy CGM - CGM source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French government has decided to sell Compagnie Generale Maritime (CGM) to Compagnie Maritime d'Affretement, a CGM source said on Monday.</p>
</text>
